Z||000000||filthyscarecrow||08-25-2001||04:57 AM||||okay, here's the shiznit: i went to the CART race last weekend and upon arriving home, everything seemed fine. then i looked at my car. apparently, that weekend, my roommate had a huge party and a couple of her drunk friends stumbled into the garage and onto my car... and put a 2 foot crack in my windshield. needless to say i am not pleased. anyone know how much a windshield replacement is? and who is the most expensive replacement? she's gonna pay out that arse for this one... <BR>judge judy here i come!||||reg||1
